{"4166670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hour of Redemption", "steam_appid": 4166670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hour of Redemption</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>action-adventure dungeon crawler</strong> where every second counts.<br>Dive into ever-changing dungeons filled with ruthless enemies and time itself as your greatest foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>one hour</strong> to fight, adapt, and conquer—fail to defeat your enemies in time, and the clock resets.<br>Master the power of <strong>Slow Time</strong>, manipulate the flow of battle, and carve your own path toward redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run pushes you further: after clearing each stage, you’ll earn <strong>unique buffs and precious seconds</strong> to extend your survival.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Based Combat:</strong> Defeat enemies before the clock runs out—or start again from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Time Mechanic:</strong> Bend time to your advantage, dodge deadly attacks, and control the pace of every fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Buff System:</strong> Gain new powers and extra time after every stage to prepare for even tougher challenges.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hour of Redemption</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>action-adventure dungeon crawler</strong> where every second counts.<br>Dive into ever-changing dungeons filled with ruthless enemies and time itself as your greatest foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>one hour</strong> to fight, adapt, and conquer—fail to defeat your enemies in time, and the clock resets.<br>Master the power of <strong>Slow Time</strong>, manipulate the flow of battle, and carve your own path toward redemption.</p><p cl